  "root_cause": "In torch 2.10.0+cu128 on the actual WSL environment, is_available, device_count, and empty_cache leave the CUDA allocator/context uninitialized. Passing a torch.device to reset_peak_memory_stats before current_device initializes CUDA reproduces Invalid device argument. Calling current_device initializes CUDA, after which all three requested call forms succeed.",
